# Force LF everywhere: the project is developed and deployed on Linux containers,
# including Docker inside WSL2 on Windows hosts, where CRLF breaks shell scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.sf2 binary
*.sf3 binary
*.onnx binary
